Description: 4k intro for Linux by Jean-Yves Lamoureux, released in 2004
 History of video game in 4k is a brief history of video games, from the
 70's to the 90's, written in less than 4096 bytes of ANSI C for the 4k
 source compo of 2004: a title in bitmap font, a pong, a road, a raycaster
 and a scroller whose text is the name of the source file.
 .
 The intro uses SDL 1.2 and 2D effects only, without sound.
